Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:56:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add CONNECTED_SHAPE_FOLLOWER to keep joined line and arc
 ends attached

Finds the lines and arcs on the same layer whose ends sit on the ends of
a shape being edited, and moves those ends with it. A following arc keeps
its included angle.

Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
